message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SupportLens: An Explainable AI Framework for Assessing Version-Support Commitments Against Vulnerability and Release Evidence"
abstract: >-
  SupportLens extracts version-support commitments from open-source security policies
  (SECURITY.md) and assesses them against vulnerability and release evidence with a
  deterministic rule engine and template-based explanations. Master research project,
  Master of Applied Artificial Intelligence, Prince Sattam bin Abdulaziz University.
